            "review_title": "Review at The Barrel",
            "review_text": "james j\nBraintree, United Kingdom4 contributions\n0\nGreat little French wine bar\nApr 2019 • Friends\nWe were walking around Hanoi and spotted a sign for a wine bar, we thought that we would try it out so we went in and ordered 1 bottle to try. It was so nice that we ordered another bottle and some food. The food cheese with some bread and it turned out to be the best cheese I have ever had.\nWritten April 12, 2019",
